      "message": "test: SRD tie-break test\n\nThe test in #33223 builds `mixed_weight_pool` but passes\n`utxo_pool` to `TestSRDSuccess`, and the max weight (804 WU) fits\nany two coins, so SRD never evicts and the tie-break never runs.\n\nPass `mixed_weight_pool` to `SelectCoinsSRD` instead of `utxo_pool` to `TestSRDSuccess`.\nadd an extra light coin and lower the max weight to 536 WU so that\n the heavier coin gets evicted on every tie.\nadd checks to assert the resulting utxos on success",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Zeegaths",
        "email": "zarahgathoni76@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-03T06:27:32Z"
